    "description": "<p>You can spend <strong>harmony </strong>instead of paying any stress cost.<br><em>This ability allows you to spend harmony in place of any single stress cost, </em><em>including those imposed by resisting a consequence or pushing yourself. Abilities </em><em>with a variable cost, such as <strong>Unravel</strong>, are considered to apply a single </em><em>cost, so spending harmony allows you access to all bonus features for 0 stress.</em></p>",
